# Qobuz Connect
# Confirmed from upmpdcli qobuz plugin (raw.py, spoofbuz.py) and SDK:
# API endpoint (all REST calls go here)
www.qobuz.com
# Web player (bundle/app secret extraction)
play.qobuz.com
# Qobuz Connect WebSocket/API (confirmed via tcpdump)
qws-us-prod.qobuz.com
# Likely subdomains (not confirmed in source but standard practice):
auth.qobuz.com
streaming.qobuz.com
static.qobuz.com
# Audio CDN — Akamai (confirmed from netstat during playback)
deploy.static.akamaitechnologies.com
# DoH
cloudflare-dns.com
# Catch-all
qobuz.com
